{"title":"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">2008 AMC 12A #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">2008 AMC 10A #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A bakery owner turns on his doughnut machine at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/8/bf8d88a6cfd8c1b6ae7fcdab7a3d9b98136f1122.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{8:30}\\ {\\small\\text{AM}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"12\" />. At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/a/30a3b3a8b0ad2c96d2767fc116b03d930b934db9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{11:10}\\ {\\small\\text{AM}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"12\" /> the machine has completed one third of the day's job. At what time will the doughnut machine complete the job?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/f/3ef148899b30592b70054b8b9ccc37c704a956f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\text{1:50}\\ {\\small\\text{PM}}\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\text{3:00}\\ {\\small\\text{PM}}\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\text{3:30}\\ {\\small\\text{PM}}\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\text{4:30}\\ {\\small\\text{PM}}\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{5:50}\\ {\\small\\text{PM}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"594\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The machine completes one-third of the job in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/6/e06fd3f6d128e56096d38c4e42e671f4a6b30fcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{11:10}-\\text{8:30}=\\text{2:40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"14\" /> hours. Thus, the entire job is completed in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e24a0041547641389c79e9c49cd6066b055977f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot(\\text{2:40})=\\text{8:00}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"18\" /> hours.\n</p><p>Since the machine was started at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/e/14e2e32d2a2758f58a5ba05f921e703eb5e0159a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{8:30 AM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />, the job will be finished <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours later, at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/b/4bb881405ea47037c708fdeab84038854dad98ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{4:30 PM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfbf4df7c25681bb178ddc50ee0c0d656aa25b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Note: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/9/749e5a619278a8bf88617f6e9ce4527b03054acb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{2:40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> multiplied by this time interval is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A\">2008 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2